<title>USA: Kemper taps AIG executive for new president.</title>
<headline>Kemper taps AIG executive for new president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kemper Insurance Cos said its board has elected William D. Smith to the position of president and chief operating officer,</p>
<p>Smith, 52, had been with American International Group Inc since April 1990, Kemper said. Most recently, he was executive vice president in charge of the domestic brokerage group, which accounts for the majority of AIG's premium base.</p>
<p>Smith will report to David Mathis, chairman and chief executive of the Kemper organization.</p>
</text>
